Subject: Re: stat_smooth: parameter specification for formula
Message-ID: <oWzs8j1Qnmc.OOP3oJDWD94J@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <oWzs8j1Qnmc.YDxb64COqR4J@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
References: <oWzs8j1Qnmc.YDxb64COqR4J@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/ggplot2/c/oWzs8j1Qnmc/m/OOP3oJDWD94J>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
